// Title: Remote Access Tool - Cmd.EXE Execution via AnyViewer
// Rule ID: bc533330-fc29-44c0-b245-7dc6e5939c87
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.persistence, detection.threat-hunting
